| info           =
*Nezha expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''100''' [[energy]] to burst spears of light from the ground, impaling enemies within a radius of {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''10 / 13 / 16 / 19''' meters and inflicting {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''150 / 300 / 450 / 600''' {{D|Puncture}} damage. Impaled enemies are incapacitated for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''6 / 8 / 10 / 12''' seconds. If Divine Spears is deactivated by pressing the ability key again (default {{Keybind|4}}), impaled enemies are slammed to the ground and dealt {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''150 / 300 / 450 / 600''' {{D|Impact}} damage.
**Cast animation of '''1''' second, affected by [[Casting Speed]].
***Casting this ability makes Nezha stop all other actions, including movement.
**Impaled enemies are treated as {{D|Knockdown}}, and thus can trigger Melee Ground [[Finisher]] attacks.
*'''Ability Synergy:''' {{A|Blazing Chakram}} striking an enemy impaled by Divine Spears produces a second chakram, which fires at a nearby enemy.
**Secondary chakrams can create additional ones off of speared enemies.
**A charged throw will also produce charged chakrams, which will not seek out enemies or bounce, and often fly off in random directions. Therefore, uncharged throws are much more well-suited to generate many chakrams and ramp up {{M|Reaping Chakram}}'s bonus damage.
